I haven't tried filling in places yet, but to start:

  galfi : x1 (event) modifies/alters/changes/transforms/converts x2 into x3.
  troci : x1 tries/attempts/makes an effort to do/attain x2
          (event/state/property) by actions/method x3.

  galfi troci => gaftoi

I haven't rigorously concluded that these gismu are the best at expressing
"tiao-shi," they're my first attempt.

-Alan

